h swift declared probe-only and the rule made structural, so Linux five and an unmeasured Windows count are both consistent; no Windows qualification claimed. SDK presentation moved to a fixed nesting depth after measuring the derivation walks three ancestor levels up. Two cycle-1 counts corrected downward (plugin paths outside the roots three to two distinct; presented-SDK 6 inside/8 absent to 6 distinct with 2 existing inside and 4 absent); security properties unchanged. Probe swift-boundary-fixture-v1: 23 cases 23 matched 0 divergences, 32 closure checks 0 verdicts, 9 of 9 controls red, 30 structural checks 0 divergences, green true exit 0; degraded run 23 not_run exit 0; tarball extracts and tests clean. Expected-red gates re-attributed: curator gofmt/make check list 754 paths, 0 outside .temp/ and 0 under this task, 0 modified tracked files; spec validate.py fails only its link check on 3 links inside copied docs this task did not author, clean baseline at 57c1f56 exits 0, scoped check over the two authored documents is 6 links / 0 broken. Nothing staged, committed, pinned or published; nothing installed on any host. New artifact: TASK-260728-1yhuqi_rework-cycle-1.md.\nagent completed: [analyst] solution-architect (claude) (exit=0)\nspawn run completed: claude (run=RUN-260728-63be8f, pid=89875, exit=0)\nREVIEW CYCLE 2 DIRECTIVE: Independently review the Swift driver-pair rework without editing producer artifacts. Verify the manager classifier is truly line-1-only and its absent/noncanonical/security partitions are total despite SwiftPM scanning strings/later lines. Treat the strict swiftc -### grammar as adversarial: replay POSIX quoting/control-byte handling, every path-token bucket, unknown/relative/unclaimed paths, resolved containment, symlink/case/dangling behavior, absent-plugin appearance, executable identity rebinding, graph/compile vector equality and the measured valid plan. Prove curator-swift-module-v1 is total for every legal command key, invertible in the short branch, collision-resistant/branch-separated in the long branch, bounded to Swift identifiers, cannot shadow reserved modules, and that command_key independently binds cache/receipt identity. Audit the total allow/reject/bound/inert matrix for response files, unsafe/compiler/linker settings, scripts, plugins/macros/binary/system/native inputs, non-visible files and Windows closure; verify the structural plan-derived executable rule, SDK presentation containment, local/external parity, toolchain/SDK identities, fixed process graph, diagnostics and honest macOS-only qualification. Re-run the full probe, all 9 expected-red controls, 30 structural checks and applicable repository/spec gates; publish exact ACCEPTED or CHANGES REQUESTED evidence. No product edits, staging, commit, publish, pin or platform widening.\nspawn agent resolution: Agent selection: codex via explicit_override\nspawn launch composition: degraded_contract_unavailable; contract=agents-infra.child-launch-composition; provider=codex; schema=1; diagnostic=composition_contract_unavailable; bare child launch retained\nspawn queued: [reviewer] reviewer (codex) (run=RUN-260729-d7ff1c, max_parallel=20)\nspawn run started: [reviewer] reviewer (codex) (run=RUN-260729-d7ff1c)
